OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but
OL,6,Fmostly dry in the evening with just a
OL,7,Ffew spots of light rain. Rain will
OL,8,Fbecome more persistent and
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy towards morning.
OL,10,FBecoming breezy around the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain especially for the Aberdeenshire
OL,14,Fcoasts, this gradually becoming
OL,15,Flighter and more patchy through the
OL,16,Fafternoon and evening. Windy at times,
OL,17,Fparticularly around the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
