OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,Fand fresh winds clearing early
OL,7,FSaturday. Further rain or showers over
OL,8,Fthe weekend with some drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,10,Flight, likely freshening later on
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
